  ('Tourismus Salzburg GmbH – salzburg.info (official Salzburg city tourist board)','Salzburg','AT','https://www.salzburg.info/de/veranstaltungen/veranstaltungskalender','A paginated city event calendar grouped by day, each row carrying title, date, time and venue as plain server-rendered HTML.',ARRAY['ausstellungen','musik','theater / show / tanz / film','führungen','volkskultur / brauchtum / märkte / feste','sport','familie','advent / weihnachten / neujahr'],'robots.txt fetched from https://www.salzburg.info/robots.txt on 2026-09-05 (HTTP 200). Rules read: User-agent: * / Disallow: / Sitemap: https://salzburg.info/sitemap.default.xml / Sitemap: https://salzburg.info/sitemap.demi_links.xml / Sitemap: https://salzburg.info/sitemap.magazin_links.xml. The endpoint path is permitted, and no Crawl-delay is declared. https://www.salzburg.info/robots.txt: ''User-agent: *'' / ''Disallow:'' (i.e. nothing blocked), plus three Sitemap lines including ''Sitemap: https://salzburg.info/sitemap.default.xml''. Two independent live passes read this listing and its robots.txt. Collect factual fields only (title, date, time, venue, city, detail URL) and deep-link back; editorial descriptions and photographs stay the publisher''s copyright.',1,'Measured locally on 2026-09-05 with the real worker extractor: 27 future-dated events, 27 distinct titles. Examples it actually returned: "Hohensalzburger Häppchen: Wunderbare Wappen - Eine heraldische Reise vom späten" "Salzburger Klassik "Musik im Mirabell"" "Flavourama Vol. XVIII - Hip Hop & House Dance Festival". Read https://www.salzburg.info/de/veranstaltungen/veranstaltungskalender (HTTP 200, 349,547 bytes; header says ''3029 Ergebnisse'', pager 1…113). Real titles with dates: ''Flavourama Vol. XVIII - Hip Hop & House Dance Festival'' — 05. Sep. 2026, 11:00, Stadt Salzburg; ''Die Seele am Faden: Friedemann Vogel'' — 05. Sep. 2026, 19:00, Salzburger Landestheater; ''Hosi Fest Pride Festival'' — 05. Sep. 2026, 20:00, ARGEkultur. Also ''Sch