  ('Piešťanské informačné centrum (PIC Piešťany — the town''s tourist information centre)','Piešťany','SK','https://www.pic-piestany.sk/podujatia/aktualne-podujatia/','A plain server-rendered list of event rows — title, dd. mm. yyyy start/end (with times where relevant), venue and a type label (''výstava'', ''prezentácia'', ''významné podujatie'') — above a long category sidebar.',ARRAY['výstavy','koncerty','festivaly','divadelné predstavenia','filmy','šport','tanec','trhy'],'robots.txt fetched from https://www.pic-piestany.sk/robots.txt on 2026-09-05 (HTTP 200). Rules read: User-agent: AhrefsBot / Disallow: /. The endpoint path is permitted, and no Crawl-delay is declared. https://www.pic-piestany.sk/robots.txt contains only ''User-agent: AhrefsBot'' / ''Disallow: /''. No rule applies to our bot and no Crawl-delay is set; the whole site is open to us. Two independent live passes read this listing and its robots.txt. Collect factual fields only (title, date, time, venue, city, detail URL) and deep-link back; editorial descriptions and photographs stay the publisher''s copyright.',1,'NOT ENABLED: the extractor produced 2 row(s) but only 2 distinct title(s). Needs a recipe, not a switch. Examples it actually returned: "Medzinárodné letecké dni Mninisterstva obrany SR" "Vyber si svoj šport". Read https://www.pic-piestany.sk/podujatia/aktualne-podujatia/ (HTTP 200, 43882 bytes). Future-dated rows include ''NOÉMI KOLČÁKOVÁ SZAKÁLLOVÁ: IKONY, 03. 09. 2026 - 30. 09. 2026, Dom umenia Piešťany, výstava''; ''Medzinárodné letecké dni Ministerstva obrany SR, 05. 09. 2026 od 09.00 h - 06. 09. 2026 do 17.00''; ''Malý návod na veľký svet, 26. 08. 2026 - 15. 10. 2026, Aupark Shopping Center''; ''Osmijankova literárna záhrada, 13. 08. 2026 - 30. 11. 2026, Mestská knižnica mesta Piešťany''. I also confirmed https://www.pic-piestany.sk/podujatia/kalendar/ (HTTP 200, 85825 bytes) renders a week grid 31.08.–06.09. with ''Akcie na dnes'' entries such as ''20:00 Nedosiahnuteľná láska, Kultúrno spoločenské centrum Fontána / film'' and ''Organové dni v Piešťanoch 2026 - 27. ročník, Dom umenia Piešťany''. The originally given /en/events returned the homepage (final URL https://www.pic-piestany.sk/),…','www.pic-piestany.sk','src_d7a81fb2',false,'render'),
  ('Visit Trenčín (city tourism portal of Mesto Trenčín / Kultúrno-informačné centrum)','Trenčín','SK','https://visit.trencin.sk/en/events/','A filterable Čo/Kde/Kedy event list, each card carrying title, category chips, ''d. m. yyyy • HH.MM'' (with an end date for multi-day items), venue and a teaser, with a ''Načítať ďalšie'' pager.',ARRAY['divadlo','koncerty','výstavy','kino','šport','festivaly','tanec','deti'],'robots.txt fetched from https://visit.trencin.sk/robots.txt on 2026-09-05 (HTTP 200). Rules read: User-agent: * / Disallow: /wp-admin/ / Disallow: /wp-includes/ / Allow: /wp-admin/admin-ajax.php / Sitemap: https://visit.trencin.sk/wp-sitemap.xml / Sitemap: https://visit.trencin.sk/sitemap_index.xml. The endpoint path is permitted, and no Crawl-delay is declared. https://visit.trencin.sk/robots.txt: ''User-agent: *'', ''Disallow: /wp-admin/'', ''Disallow: /wp-includes/'', ''Allow: /wp-admin/admin-ajax.php'', plus two Sitemap lines. /en/events/ is allowed; no Crawl-delay. Two independent live passes read this listing and its robots.txt. Collect factual fields only (title, date, time, venue, city, detail URL) and deep-link back; editorial descriptions and photographs stay the publisher''s copyright.',1,'NOT ENABLED: both judging passes accepted this listing, but our extractor collected ZERO future-dated events from it on 2026-09-05. Registered so the endpoint and its robots clearance are not lost; it needs a selector recipe before it can be switched on. Read https://visit.trencin.sk/en/events/ (HTTP 200, 161751 bytes; the /en/ path still serves Slovak event text). Future-dated cards in the raw HTML: ''Pri Trenčianskej bráne — Festivaly, Jarmoky, Koncerty — 4. 9. 2026 • 10.00 – 6. 9. 2026 — Mierové námestie''; ''King Of The Castle 2026 — Šport — 5. 9. 2026 • 10.00 — Posádkový klub''; ''Dni Sihote 2026 — Koncerty — 5. 9. 2026 • 11.00 – 6. 9. 2026 17.00 — Rozkvet na Sihoti''; ''FestArt na Garáži — Koncerty, Výstavy — 5. 9. 2026 • 15.00 — Bunky na Looke''. The site''s own filter vocabulary is visible on the page: Divadlo, Koncerty, Leto, Výstavy, Deti, Seniori, Prednášky, Kino, Kurzy, Šport, Festivaly, Tanec. No ld+json Event blocks, so this is a render target, not a jsonld one. SECOND PASS CONFIRMED: From my own curl on 2026-09-05: ''Pri Trenčianskej bráne — Festivaly, Jarmoky, Koncerty, Tip…','visit.trencin.sk','src_70ea32dc',false,'render')

) AS v(
  publisher_name, city, country_code, endpoint_url, format, categories, legal_basis,
  dedupe_priority, parser_strategy, host, source_id, scrape_enabled, scrape_strategy
)
-- Host guard: never register a host the collector already has, whatever id it carries.
-- ON CONFLICT only protects source_id, and the V5 lesson stands -- dedupe on the FINAL
-- endpoint host, not the name the workbook arrived with.
WHERE NOT EXISTS (
  SELECT 1 FROM public.external_event_feed_sources existing
  WHERE existing.endpoint_url IS NOT NULL
    AND lower(regexp_replace(split_part(regexp_replace(existing.endpoint_url, '^https?://', ''), '/', 1), '^www\.', ''))
      = lower(regexp_replace(v.host, '^www\.', ''))
)
ON CONFLICT (source_id) DO NOTHING;
